      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_sp02_select_04",
      "hash64": "0525F67097BB1266",
      "text": "¡Mira que eres majo!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_paldea_friend_sp02_07",
      "hash64": "C6DAFD4A1C28C3EC",
      "text": "¿Cómo que \"qué bien\"? ¡Fue horrible!\\c\\nAunque, bueno, supongo que para ellos sí estuvo\\nbien, que comieron gratis...[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
